<title>JAPAN: NCB's debts do not exceed assets - MOF.</title>
<headline>NCB's debts do not exceed assets - MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Credit Bank Ltd's (NCB) debts do not exceed its assets, Kimio Yamaguchi, director-general of the Finance Ministry's Banking Bureau, told a parliamentary committee on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Yamaguchi said his statement was based on the Finance Ministry's examination of the bank's self-assessment of its asset situation.</p>
</text>
